 proxygen  compress headerpiecetests testing  test     
 
test f headerpiecetests  basic    
  headerpiece  hp  
 
    
  hp headerpiece 0 expect hp- ismultivalued hp buf 16   
  hp headerpiece buf  16 true   
  expect eq hp- str data    buf   
  expect eq hp- str size    16 hp  
   proxygen lib http codec compress test headerpiecetests